IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TELEMETRY-HISTORY.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT OPTIONAL HISTORY-FILE
        ASSIGN TO "telemetry_history.txt"
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD HISTORY-FILE.
01 HISTORY-RECORD PIC X(50).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 HEALTH-SCORE   PIC 9(3) VALUE 045.
01 INCIDENT-COUNT PIC 9(2) VALUE 03.
01 ALERT-CODE     PIC X    VALUE "A".

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    OPEN EXTEND HISTORY-FILE

    MOVE SPACES TO HISTORY-RECORD
    STRING
        "HEALTH=" HEALTH-SCORE
        ",INCIDENTS=" INCIDENT-COUNT
        ",ALERT=" ALERT-CODE
        DELIMITED BY SIZE
        INTO HISTORY-RECORD
    END-STRING

    WRITE HISTORY-RECORD
    CLOSE HISTORY-FILE

    DISPLAY "HISTORY RECORD APPENDED"
    STOP RUN.
